  m_text: "Game Title: Blob Bound\r\nDeveloped by: Shadow51\r\n\r\nDEVELOPMENT\r\nGame
    Design: Shadow51  \r\nProgramming: Shadow51  \r\nArt & Animation: Shadow51  \r\nSound
    Design: Shadow51  \r\nMusic Design: Spring Spring and GWriterStudio\r\nUI/UX
    Design: Shadow51  \r\nTesting & QA: Shadow51 and Community\r\n\r\n\r\nSPECIAL
    THANKS\r\nTo everyone who believed, supported,  \r\nand inspired this journey. 
    \r\nTo the gamers who played, broke,  \r\nand rebuilt this world alongside us.\r\n\r\nSpecial
    gratitude to:\r\nFamily & Friends\r\nFellow Devs in the Community\r\nYou \u2014
    the Player\r\n\r\nFINAL WORDS\r\nEvery pixel, every line of code,\r\nevery sleepless
    night\u2014\r\nfor the love of creation.\r\n\r\nThis world was built by one name:\r\n\r\n^_^
    SHADOW51 ^_^\r\n\r\nThank you for playing.\r\nSee you in the next world.\r\n"
